# SVC claims, evidence, and pinned artifacts are hash-pinned. Any line-ending
# conversion (e.g. CRLF on Windows) silently corrupts L1/L2/L3, so the whole
# repo is pinned as non-text. Source/docs are explicitly LF-normalized.
* -text
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
